{"pageid": 760, "title": "Joe Cavanaugh", "revid": 1664, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Joe Cavanaugh</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/JoeCavanaugh13.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215171919\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"JoeCavanaugh13\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/JoeCavanaugh13.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20241215171919\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/JoeCavanaugh13.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20241215171919 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/5/5d/JoeCavanaugh13.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215171919 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"JoeCavanaugh13\" width=\"270\" height=\"206\" data-image-key=\"JoeCavanaugh13.png\" data-image-name=\"JoeCavanaugh13.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sheriff</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a> Police Department</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim Cavanaugh</a> <small>(brother)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">This is all out of my depth. This is all so fucking horrible I don't know how to process any of it. And the next part is going to be so much worse.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #6</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Joe Cavanaugh</b> is the Sheriff of <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> and the presiding officer over the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span> of 2020. Intent on solving the disappearances and deaths of multiple children, Joe ended up roped into <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>'s hunt and only barely escaped with his life after the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> intervened. He was forced to arrest <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> for the murders, despite knowing his innocence, in order to save the rest of the town.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Sheriff Cavanaugh is an older Caucasian man with black hair, brown eyes, and a mustache.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\">Issue #2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\">Issue #3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\">Issue #4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\">Issue #5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\">Issue #10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">Issue #11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">Issue #12</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\">Issue #13</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\">Issue #14</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">Issue #15</a></li></u